    {
      "t": "list",
      "items": [
        "Compose and focus **before** fitting a strong filter: the view gets very dark.",
        "Strong NDs can add a colour cast. Shoot RAW, or set a custom white balance through the filter.",
        "Variable NDs show a dark X across wide-angle shots at their strongest end."
      ]
    },
